n Trash are deleted forever after 30 days."}],["$","li","2",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Restore: open Trash on the left side, right-click the file, and choose Restore. It goes back to where it was."}],["$","li","3",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Delete forever: in Trash, right-click › Delete forever. Empty trash deletes everything in Trash forever."}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 text-gray-800 leading-relaxed bg-yellow-50 border-yellow-400","children":[false,"Delete forever and Empty trash cannot be undone from Drive. Before you empty the Trash, look through it for anything a coworker might still need."]}],["$","$L20","3",{"block":{"type":"drag-drop","mode":"sort","title":"Can you get it back?","prompt":"Sort each situation.","buckets":[{"id":"yes","label":"Yes, restore it from Trash"},{"id":"no","label":"No, it is gone from Drive"}],"items":[{"id":"t1","text":"Moved to Trash yesterday","bucket":"yes"},{"id":"t2","text":"Moved to Trash, then Delete forever","bucket":"no"},{"id":"t3","text":"Moved to Trash two weeks ago","bucket":"yes"},{"id":"t4","text":"Moved to Trash, then someone clicked Empty trash","bucket":"no"},{"id":"t5","text":"Moved to Trash more than 30 days ago","bucket":"no"}],"explanation":"Trash holds files for 30 days. Delete forever, Empty trash, or the 30-day limit ends that."}}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6","children":"Files you do not own"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Only the owner can delete a file. If you remove a file someone else owns, it disappears from your Drive, but the owner and everyone else with access still have it. To get rid of a shared file for everyone, ask its owner."}],["$","div","1",{"className":"bg-green-50 border-l-4 border-green-400 p-4 rounded-xl text-gray-800 leading-relaxed","children":["$L